    "分享面板会列出已安装的微信、Line、X 等应用；保存到相册只需要“添加照片”权限，不会读取相册。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The share sheet lists installed apps such as WeChat, LINE and X. Saving to Photos needs only “Add Photos Only” access and never reads your library."
          }
