    "卡片包含专题说明、各处图版和你的到访进度；私人笔记与评价不会出现在卡片上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The card shows the list description, each plate and your visit progress; private notes and reviews never appear on it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードには特集の説明、各古跡の図版、訪問の進み具合が入ります。個人のメモや評価は載りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡片包含古迹资料、图版、到访日期和你选择附上的评价；私人笔记不会出现在卡片上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The card shows the monument's details, its plate, your visit date and any review you choose to add; private notes never appear on it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードには古跡の情報、図版、訪問日、添えることを選んだ評価が入ります。個人のメモは載りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原因见上方说明；关闭附近筛选可继续浏览全部。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "See the note above for why. Turn off Nearby to keep browsing everything."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "理由は上の説明をご覧ください。「近く」を解除するとすべて閲覧できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原始构件、整体形制与历史痕迹保留了多少" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How much original fabric, overall form and historical trace remains"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当初の部材、全体の形式、歴史の痕跡がどれだけ残っているか"
